#. あのさ…本当にこの図書室にあるの？
#. ジェノサイダー翔の犯行を示す<CLT 3>根拠<CLT>ってのが…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Umm...is the <CLT 3>evidence<CLT> that proves it was Genocide\n"
"Jack really in the library?"
msgstr ""

#. …何度も言わせるな。
msgctxt "0002 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "...Don't make me say it again."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今は、こんな物を気にしている場合じゃないな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on. I\n"
"can't think about this right now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕は監視カメラで見ていたはずだ。
#. 不二咲さんが殺されたところも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The mastermind must have been watching as Chihiro was\n"
"killed...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕はそれを知った上で…
#. ボクらにこんな事をさせているのか…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They know what's happened, and they're still forcing\n"
"us to go through with this...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. そんな所を調べても意味はないぞ。
#. もっとマシな手掛かりを見つけろ…
msgctxt "0007 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"There's no point in checking there. We need to find\n"
"real clues."
msgstr ""

#. そこに手掛かりはないぞ…
#. 別の場所を調べろ…
msgctxt "0008 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "There are no clues there. We need to check elsewhere."
msgstr ""

#. そこに手掛かりはないぞ…
#. 別の場所を調べろ…
msgctxt "0009 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "There are no clues there. We need to check elsewhere."
msgstr ""

#. そこに手掛かりはないぞ…
#. 別の場所を調べろ…
msgctxt "0010 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "There are no clues there. We need to check elsewhere."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このドアの向こうって、確か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If I remember, on the other side of this door...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>書庫<CLT>…だったよね？
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's the <CLT 3>archive<CLT>, right?"
msgstr ""

#. さっそく、中に入るとしよう。
msgctxt "0013 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Hurry up and go inside."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…ここに？
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh...here?"
msgstr ""

#. 中に入ればわかる…
msgctxt "0015 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "It'll all make sense once you're inside."
msgstr ""

#. やめろ…今は電気スタンドなど関係ないはずだ…！
msgctxt "0016 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Knock it off. What does a desk lamp matter right\n"
"now...!?"
msgstr ""

#. そんな物を調べても意味はないぞ。
#. もっとマシな手掛かりを見つけろ…
msgctxt "0017 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"There's no point in checking there. We need to find\n"
"real clues."
msgstr ""

#. 待て…
#. まだ調べるべき事があるだろう。
msgctxt "0018 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Hold on. We still have more to check here."
msgstr ""
